       "target": "kh"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "br"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "A to H is 3 hops, through E. Remove E, and the best route becomes A, B, D, G, J, H: 5 hops. So E is a bridge device."
